        "retained": [
          "In move_me, restore sorted box positions by shifting the moved box toward its new position only when a box is pushed; leave the box list untouched on walking moves."
        ]
      },
      "hypothesis": "Replacing the unconditional bubble-sort pass with an in-place insertion shift only when a box moves should remove unnecessary ordering work from walking moves and reduce box-order restoration work on pushes, while preserving the sorted box-position invariant used by state hashing and equality checks.",
