          "src/sokoban.c"
        ],
        "retained": [
          "On box pushes, restore sorted box positions with an in-place insertion shift; leave box ordering untouched on walking moves.",
          "In lookup(), check stored hash equality before memcmp, retaining the full coordinate comparison for exact collision resolution."
        ]
      },
      "hypothesis": "Combining sorted-list insertion on box pushes with a hash check before exact state comparison may speed full BFS workloads: ordinary walking avoids box-order restoration, and bucket entries with different hashes avoid memcmp. The combined effect is uncertain and should be measured rather than inferred from the isolated runs.",
